flowchart LR
    User((Customer)) --> ALB[Internet-facing Application Load Balancer]
    subgraph VPC[Single VPC 10.0.0.0/16]
      IGW[Internet Gateway]
      NAT[NAT Gateway]
      subgraph AZ1[Availability Zone A]
        PubA[Public subnet]
        AppA[Private application subnet]
        DbA[Private database subnet]
      end
      subgraph AZ2[Availability Zone B]
        PubB[Public subnet]
        AppB[Private application subnet]
        DbB[Private database subnet]
      end
      ALB --> PubA
      ALB --> PubB
      ASG[EC2 Auto Scaling Group] --- AppA
      ASG --- AppB
      RDS[(Private Amazon RDS PostgreSQL)] --- DbA
      RDS --- DbB
      Lambda[AWS Lambda in private app subnets] --- AppA
      Lambda --- AppB
      AppA -. S3 Gateway Endpoint .-> S3[(Private S3 bucket)]
      AppB -. S3 Gateway Endpoint .-> S3
      Lambda -. Secrets Manager Interface Endpoint .-> Secrets[Secrets Manager]
      Lambda -. CloudWatch Logs Interface Endpoint .-> Logs[CloudWatch Logs]
      S3 -- ObjectCreated event --> Lambda
      Lambda --> RDS
      IGW -. public route .-> PubA
      IGW -. public route .-> PubB
      NAT -. private subnet egress .-> AppA
      NAT -. private subnet egress .-> AppB
      IGW --- NAT
    end
